{
  "name": "02 · Smart Follow-Up Sequence (stops when they reply)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Never let a lead go cold\nWeekdays 09:10 it reads **Leads**, picks rows where `next_follow_up` ≤ today and stage is open.\n\n- Checks Gmail first: anyone who replied is moved to `replied` and **not** emailed\n- Claude writes touch #2, #3, #4 with a different angle each time (value → proof → break-up)\n- Updates touches, dates, stage. After `maxTouches` → `nurture`",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3bb0cdb5-d383-4952-89df-e3696894a15b",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "10 9 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
